        "short_description": "Ben E. Keith Foods is a prominent American food and beverage distribution company based in Fort Worth, Texas. Founded in 1906, it has evolved from delivering produce by horse and buggy to becoming a major player in the foodservice industry. The company operates primarily through two divisions: the Food Division, which supplies a wide range of products including fresh produce, frozen foods, meats, and dry groceries, and the Beverage Division, known for distributing Anheuser-Busch products and a variety of other beverages.\n\nWith a strong presence in Texas and surrounding regions, Ben E. Keith Foods serves a diverse customer base that includes restaurants, hospitals, schools, and nursing homes. The company is recognized as one of the largest independent beer wholesalers in the U.S. and has expanded its operations through strategic acquisitions and investments in facilities, such as a large warehouse in Missouri City, Texas. Ben E. Keith Foods is committed to quality, service, and supporting its employees and customers, reflecting a legacy of innovation and excellence in the food and beverage distribution sector.",
