        "short_description": "United General Supply Co., Inc is a family-owned design, import, and distribution company based in Houston, Texas. From peddling hand-tools at flea markets to selling to multi-billion dollar companies 30 years later, our family is a living example that with hard work and the right team, anything is possible.\n\nWe take great pride in not only our unique products, but also in providing great value and service to our customers. We want our values of family and togetherness to be transferred through our products, and through our Leigh Country brand, we want to inspire people to be with the ones they love in a natural setting.\n\nLeigh Country brings an authentic country living experience direct to your home, no matter where you live. For more information on our Leigh Country family, visit www.leighcountry.com, like us on Facebook at facebook.com/leighcountry, follow us on Twitter at twitter.com/LeighCountry and on Instagram at instagram.com/LeighCountry, and pin with us on Pinterest at pinterest.com/leighcountry.",
