        "short_description": "Austin Regional Clinic (ARC) is a physician-owned, multi-specialty healthcare organization based in Central Texas, founded in 1980 by Dr. Norman H. Chenven. Serving around 700,000 patients, ARC operates more than 35 clinics across 15 cities, including Austin. The organization is dedicated to providing coordinated and accessible healthcare, emphasizing personalized care and strong doctor-patient relationships.\n\nARC offers a wide array of healthcare services, including primary care, specialty care across 17 specialties, preventive care, chronic disease management, and urgent care through After Hours Clinics. Patients can access same-day in-person and telemedicine appointments, along with convenient features like 24/7 online scheduling and a patient portal called ARC MyChart. The clinic also utilizes advanced medical technologies, such as the daVinci robotic surgery system, to enhance patient care.\n\nWith a commitment to quality and community-centered care, ARC has established itself as a leader in healthcare delivery in the region, retaining over 90% of its patients by allowing them the freedom to choose their healthcare providers.",
